RyzenAdj (the `bin/ryzenadj` binary)
------------------------------------
Version 0.19.0
Copyright (C) 2018-2024 Jiaxun Yang and contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/FlyGoat/RyzenAdj

RyzenAdj is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3.
The full text is available at: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html

The binary is **not** distributed in this plugin's release archive. It is
downloaded on first run from the project's official GitHub releases, over
https, from a fixed allowlist of GitHub hosts, and stored in `bin/ryzenadj`
inside the plugin directory. Anyone who prefers to supply their own build can
drop it there before the plugin first starts and nothing will be fetched.

The plugin invokes RyzenAdj as a separate process and does not link against
it, so the plugin's own source remains under the BSD 3-Clause License. Anyone
redistributing this plugin must keep this notice intact.

RyzenAdj is only needed for the extended TDP range in the Extras section. The
standard range is written through the Lenovo WMI firmware attributes, so the
plugin degrades gracefully when the download fails - only the extended range
is lost.
